WEBVTT

00:00:32.969 --> 00:00:34.029
<v><b>B:</b></v> Hey.

00:00:35.283 --> 00:00:36.006
<v><b>I:</b></v> Hey, Ben.

00:00:37.661 --> 00:00:38.559
Are you OK?

00:00:39.077 --> 00:00:39.946
<v><b>B:</b></v> I’m fine.

00:00:40.703 --> 00:00:41.162
Let’s go.

00:00:42.036 --> 00:00:42.939
<v><b>I:</b></v> Have you warmed up yet?

00:00:43.823 --> 00:00:45.337
<v><b>M:</b></v> I can help you stretch if you like.

00:00:46.030 --> 00:00:48.183
Warming up is very important.

00:00:50.225 --> 00:00:50.800
<v><b>I:</b></v> Yes.

00:00:51.289 --> 00:00:53.115
Max has some great ideas for warming up.

00:00:53.745 --> 00:00:55.864
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yeah, I saw them.

00:00:56.919 --> 00:00:58.066
Thanks, Max.

00:00:59.170 --> 00:00:59.815
I’m OK.

00:01:00.498 --> 00:01:01.123
I’ve warmed up.

00:01:02.119 --> 00:01:02.798
I ran here.

00:01:03.955 --> 00:01:04.375
Let’s go.

00:01:29.272 --> 00:01:31.718
<v><b>I:</b></v> Ben? What’s wrong?

00:01:33.208 --> 00:01:35.479
<v><b>B:</b></v> Just uhh… out of breath…

00:01:36.338 --> 00:01:36.963
<v><b>M:</b></v> OK.

00:01:37.212 --> 00:01:38.003
Take a break.

00:01:38.555 --> 00:01:39.034
Here.

00:01:47.969 --> 00:01:50.498
It’s important to drink water when you’re exercising.

00:01:52.661 --> 00:01:53.257
<v><b>B:</b></v> It’s cool.

00:01:57.617 --> 00:01:58.428
I’m OK now.

00:01:59.565 --> 00:02:00.044
Come on.

00:02:00.811 --> 00:02:03.067
<v><b>M:</b></v> Maybe slow down a bit, Ben?

00:02:04.805 --> 00:02:05.747
<v><b>B:</b></v> Don’t worry about me.

00:02:06.987 --> 00:02:07.402
I’m fine.

00:03:07.139 --> 00:03:07.510
<v><b>I:</b></v> Huh.

00:03:08.975 --> 00:03:10.079
A text from Carla.

00:03:11.914 --> 00:03:12.695
‘Hi, Izzy.

00:03:12.822 --> 00:03:14.555
Ben’s not answering his texts.

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:19.478
How’s his back? He went home from work early.’

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:23.570
What’s the matter with your back?

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:25.655
<v><b>B:</b></v> It’s nothing serious.

00:03:26.108 --> 00:03:27.246
<v><b>I:</b></v> Nothing serious?

00:03:28.442 --> 00:03:29.243
Look at you.

00:03:33.906 --> 00:03:38.071
<v><b>B:</b></v> OK, I hurt it this morning, moving heavy boxes.

00:03:40.454 --> 00:03:42.139
<v><b>I:</b></v> Why didn’t you tell me when I called?

00:03:44.033 --> 00:03:45.849
Why did you run with a bad back?

00:03:46.758 --> 00:03:48.555
<v><b>B:</b></v> Look, I thought I was OK.

00:03:50.215 --> 00:03:51.284
I took some ibuprofen.

00:03:52.813 --> 00:03:54.419
<v><b>I:</b></v> Why did you run so fast?

00:03:55.171 --> 00:03:57.437
You and Max were running like it was the Olympics.

00:04:02.529 --> 00:04:03.452
<v><b>B:</b></v> I don’t know what you mean.

00:04:05.767 --> 00:04:08.584
<v><b>I:</b></v> You were being silly, both of you,

00:04:10.737 --> 00:04:13.755
but especially you, with a bad back.

00:04:16.196 --> 00:04:18.393
<v><b>B:</b></v> Look, I feel fine.

00:04:25.557 --> 00:04:26.324
What time is it?

00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:30.727
<v><b>I:</b></v> It’s six.